  - title: 02 / Send and release
    explanation: "Turn SEND on. The transmitter LED draws about 6.4 mA. The receiver
      contact closes and sinks about 5 mA through the 1 k\u03A9 pull-up. RX drops
      near 0 V. Turn SEND off and the pull-up returns RX to about 5 V."
    caption: "ACTIVE-LOW OUTPUT  \u2022  SEND ON MEANS RX LOW"
    parts:
    - id: tx-supply
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.78}
      label: TX +5 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.35, b: 0.42, a: 1}
    - id: send
      kind: 9
