  - title: 03 / Prove independent receiver power
    explanation: Turn SEND on again, then turn RX POWER off. The transmitter LED
      stays on and the receiver shows UNPOWERED. Restore RX POWER and confirm RX
      goes LOW again while SEND remains on.
    caption: THE RECEIVER HAS ITS OWN POWER SUPPLY
    parts:
    - id: tx-supply
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.78}
      label: TX +5 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.35, b: 0.42, a: 1}
