  - title: 04 / Detect and remove the bridge
    explanation: Add the temporary W08 wire between TX_RETURN and RX_RETURN. RX may
      still read LOW while the indicator changes to BRIDGED. Remove W08, turn SEND
      off to see HIGH, then turn SEND on to verify LOW with isolation restored.
    caption: THE OUTPUT CAN WORK WHILE ISOLATION IS LOST
    parts:
    - id: tx-supply
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.78}
      label: TX +5 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.35, b: 0.42, a: 1}
    - id: send
